      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bisbee%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bisbee donated a portion of its townsite to allow railroads to pass through the village.",
