      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bisbee%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1890, Colonel Bisbee was chosen by county commissioners to solicit drought relief and served in the North Dakota Senate.",
